#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
VULNOT Multi-Protocol ICS & Agentic AI Grammar Fuzzer & Replay Injector
=======================================================================
Offensive Red Team tool complementing protocol-specific clients with:
1. `fuzz-modbus`: Mutates MBAP length headers, broadcast unit IDs (0x00), undocumented
   Schneider UMAS FC 90 / Mei FC 43, and register boundary overflows.
2. `fuzz-dnp3`: Generates malformed DNP3 data-link CRCs, unsolicited response storms,
   and CVE-2015-5374 SIPROTEC protective relay DoS frames.
3. `fuzz-s7`: Fuzzes COTP TPDU sizes, S7comm parameter blocks, and PI service calls (0x28/0x29).
4. `fuzz-mcp`: Fuzzes AI SCADA Copilot MCP JSON-RPC tool schemas, delimiter injection,
   and context-window prompt boundary overrides (MITRE ATLAS AML.T0051).
5. `replay-mitm`: Captures a baseline OT telemetry window and synthesizes a Stuxnet /
   FrostyGoop style HMI telemetry replay + physical register sabotage payload.
"""

